---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About SSEGU" description="Learn about SSEGU.">
  <div class="shell prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About SSEGU</p>
    <h1>Inform. Educate. Empower.</h1>
    <p>
      SSEGU is a Uganda-focused digital platform for useful news, explainers, practical information
      and opportunities. We aim to make information easier to find, understand and use in everyday
      life.
    </p>
    <h2>What we publish</h2>
    <p>
      The news side covers current affairs, business, technology, education, lifestyle, travel,
      sports and other topics relevant to readers in Uganda and beyond. Articles may include
      reporting, commentary, explainers or practical guides; the nature of a piece should be clear
      from its context.
    </p>
    <p>
      SSEGU Work brings together job and internship listings, career advice, skills resources and CV
      guidance. Employer-submitted opportunities may be reviewed, edited or declined before
      publication. A listing on SSEGU Work is not a guarantee of a job, interview or employer
      outcome.
    </p>
    <h2>Our approach</h2>
    <p>
      We seek to present information clearly, identify uncertainty where it matters and correct
      material errors when they are brought to our attention. Publication does not make a source,
      employer, product, service or linked website an endorsement by SSEGU.
    </p>
    <p>
      SSEGU is an information platform. Readers should verify important details with the relevant
      organisation or qualified professional before acting, especially on legal, medical, financial,
      employment or safety matters.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions, corrections, partnership enquiries and employer enquiries can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:africa.is.so.rich@gmail.com">africa.is.so.rich@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
